            <title>[LU-21303] sanity-lnet test_237: Expected N-N &gt;= 50 with b2_15 router (MR forwarding)</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21303</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Patrickbot &amp;lt;patrick-bot@mulberrytree.us&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/c185cdbb-02e2-46e1-93dd-5146f95e93ab" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/c185cdbb-02e2-46e1-93dd-5146f95e93ab&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_237 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Expected 17-5 &amp;gt;= 50
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Interop&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Client&lt;br/&gt;
Lustre: 2.17.62.1&lt;br/&gt;
Branch: master&lt;br/&gt;
Build: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/137557" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/137557&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Kernel: 5.14.0-611.55.1.el9_7.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Server&lt;br/&gt;
Lustre: 2.15.8&lt;br/&gt;
Branch: b2_15&lt;br/&gt;
Build: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-b2_15/117" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-b2_15/117&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Kernel: 4.18.0-553.82.1.el8_lustre.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;sanity-lnet test_237 (MR forwarding, added with the router MR forwarding feature, fixed by &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19827" title="MR Forwarding not working correctly after LU-18444" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-19827"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-19827&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;) and test_238 (non-MR source, same helper do_mr_forwarding_test) fail in interop when the router is a b2_15 server, which has no MR forwarding: test_237 "Expected 17-5 &amp;gt;= 50", test_238 "Expected 55-5 &amp;lt; 50". Same signature "Expected N-N &amp;gt;= N" / "Expected N-N &amp;lt; N" on b2_15 full-part-1 branch runs (lustre-master 4 of 36, lustre-master-next 2 of 42 for 237) with no ticket. Seen on custom-group review session 1c01ce0e-9492-4a9c-b00a-c6624a7d91b5 for change 71303 (a test_256 skip only). Likely fix: skip both tests when the routers are older than the MR forwarding change. Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-71303-ps2-e733ee364671 on &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/71303" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/71303&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
